{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o064c","title":"曹叡不因霖雨召回司马懿","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o064c-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"曹叡不因霖雨召回司马懿","evidence":["mingdi-e-o064c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"拒绝召还","evidence":["mingdi-e-o064c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":238,"label":"征辽东遇霖雨时，回叙","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y238","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o059","basis":"征辽东遇霖雨时，回叙"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o064c-q","mingdi-q-o059","mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o064c-q","source_order":[3,460,"O064c"],"order":956}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o064c-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-526d5869563c69be8074","layer":"original","quote":"冬十一月，录讨渊功，太尉宣王以下，增邑、封爵各有差。初，帝议遣宣王讨渊，发卒四万人。议臣皆以为“四万兵多，役费难供〖8〗”。帝曰：“四千里征伐，虽云用奇〖9〗，亦当任力〖10〗，不当稍计役费〖11〗。”遂以四万人行。及宣王至辽东，霖雨，不得时攻〖12〗；群臣或以为“渊未可猝破，宜诏宣王还”。帝曰：“司马懿临危制变，擒渊可计日待也。”卒皆如所策〖13〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":459,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":177},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：景初二年（公元 238 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-917b5dc4aecce5a0dcf4","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"mingdi-q-o059","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5790b2efe14805978c50","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，诏太尉司马宣王。率众讨辽东。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
